ot/issues/112674#issuecomment-4020108116","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112674","id":4020108116,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7vnftU","user":{"login":"prvak","id":2436340,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzYzNDA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2436340?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prvak","html_url":"https://github.com/prvak","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prvak/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prvak/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prvak/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prvak/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prvak/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prvak/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prvak/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prvak/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prvak/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-08T22:02:40Z","updated_at":"2026-03-08T22:02:40Z","body":"I am not sure what kind of limit are we hitting here but it is very constraining. It is also confusing because in my case after adding cca 10 instances of one material another unrelated material turned black. It took me some time to figure out that it was caused by reaching some limit of \"instance uniform\" variables.\n\nSome observations:\n- Reproducible in Chrome and Firefox on Linux.\n- Reproducible in Firefox on Android.\n- The material counts towards the limit even if the node is invisible.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4020108116/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issue